     "<div dir=\"ltr\">With geom_raster() on a different data set I had the exact same problem trying to change the color scale to anything but the default (blues) using scale_fill_brewer(). For example, specifying any of these two has no effect:<div><br></div><div>scale_color_brewer(type = &quot;seq&quot;, palette = 3)</div><div>or</div><div>scale_color_brewer(type = &quot;div&quot;, palette = &quot;Spectral&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>But I was able to get around using scale_fill_gradientn() or scale_fill_gradient().</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">Daniel</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sat, Sep 27, 2014 at 7:46 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:20px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!forum/ggplot2/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(51,51,51)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!forum/ggplot2/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3OauBVfxxDogx3N0wizkP-\">\r\n              ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;font-family:arial\"><a style=\"color:rgb(221,75,57);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zMlSw2skUjWvAPz00L_gL\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zMlSw2skUjWvAPz00L_gL\"><img style=\"border:0px;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_936370708709949830_148b79f99527b491_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n  \r\n    Topic digest\r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!forum/ggplot2/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!forum/ggplot2/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3OauBVfxxDogx3N0wizkP-\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-family:arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_936370708709949830_148b79f99527b491_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Change colour scale in stat_contour()</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119)\">2 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_936370708709949830_148b79f99527b491_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0px 5px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/t/4a63c634982626c1?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/t/4a63c634982626c1?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24pBZ_NEOKPWXWjNgaAezx\">\r\n      Change colour scale in stat_contour()\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          Kevin Stierhoff - NOAA Federal &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kevin.s...@noaa.gov</a>&gt;: Sep 26 02:00PM -0700\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        I&#39;m having difficulty changing the color scale to anything but the default<br>\r\n&#39;blues&#39; for contour plots with geom = &quot;polygon&quot;. I&#39;ve tried<br>\r\nscale_fill_gradient(), etc. with no success. I&#39;m sure it&#39;s simple, but I&#39;m<br>\r\nstuck. Code and example plot below. Data attached.<br>\r\nThanks,<br>\r\nKevin<br>\r\n <br>\r\nload(interp_out.Rdata)<br>\r\nv &lt;- ggplot(interp.out, aes(x, y, z = z))<br>\r\n <br>\r\nv + stat_contour(geom=&quot;polygon&quot;, aes(fill=..level..),binwidth=2) +<br>\r\nstat_contour(binwidth=2) + facet_wrap(~freq) +<br>\r\n  scale_x_continuous(&#39;\\nAthwartship Beam Angle (deg)&#39;) +<br>\r\nscale_y_continuous(&#39;Alongship Beam Angle (deg)\\n&#39;) +<br>\r\n  theme_bw()<br>\r\n <br>\r\n[image: Inline image 1]<br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n      <tr><td style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          Brandon Hurr &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">brando...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Sep 27 07:01AM -0700\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Kevin,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nI&#39;m not sure what your issue is, but scale_fill_gradient() works very well<br>\r\nfor me.<br>\r\nSee:<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradient.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradient.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3c05qo8SfLd0LgPGZtqe4j\">http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradient.html</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradient2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradient2.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207742000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mfjPzZYnBSTlQfHSIX0Tg\">http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradient2.html</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradientn.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradientn.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207742000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08NmtSu6767_IX-X-Iugv_\">http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.3.1/scale_gradientn.html</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nggplot(interp.out, aes(x, y, z = z)) +<br>\r\nstat_contour(geom=&quot;polygon&quot;, aes(fill=..level..),binwidth=2) +<br>\r\nstat_contour(binwidth=2) + facet_wrap(~freq) +<br>\r\nscale_x_continuous(&#39;\\nAthwartship Beam Angle (deg)&#39;) +<br>\r\nscale_y_continuous(&#39;Alongship Beam Angle (deg)\\n&#39;) +<br>\r\ntheme_bw()+<br>\r\nscale_fill_gradient(low=&quot;red&quot;, high=&quot;darkblue&quot;)<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThanks for the reproducible example! Very helpful.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nB<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n[image: Inline image 1]<br>\r\nOn Fri, Sep 26, 2014 at 2:00 PM, Kevin Stierhoff - NOAA Federal &lt;<br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_936370708709949830_148b79f99527b491_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(99,99,99);font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!forum/ggplot2/join\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!forum/ggplot2/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370207742000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0W0yicLGJLtdU24XK2v56M\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr></tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div></div></div>\r\n</div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
